<title>HONG KONG: Varitronix Int'l 1996 net up three pct.</title>
<headline>Varitronix Int'l 1996 net up three pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   91.0   vs 91.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    45.0   vs 32.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs 3.51 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    253.75 vs 246.43</p>
<p>    Turnover		     683.87 vs 679.52</p>
<p>    Company name		 Varitronix International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 3-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Varitronix International is a liquid crystal display manufacturer and designer.</p>
<p>Share earnings are based on a weighted average of 279 million shares vs 271 million.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 60 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 15 cents) vs 41.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
